Integer subtraction is taking away an amount of objects. 

The way you do that is by understanding that objects have a permement space in the world. 
If there are 4 doctors working on a case, and 3 doctors give up and go home, there is only 1 doctor working on the case! 
Which is the same as 4-3=1. See! Using this example we can tell that subtraction is the understanding of objects having plurality and that groups can be made smaller. 
